cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "No Witness, No Verdict: Fail-Closed, Receipt-Bound State Transitions for Long-Horizon Agents"
abstract: >-
  A fail-closed architecture in which every consequential agent state
  transition must discharge typed obligations for identity, authority,
  evidence admissibility, program and environment binding, continuity,
  and side-effect scope. Separates reflection from promotion: self-evolution
  may generate candidates but cannot grant authority.
authors:
  - family-names: Leishman
    given-names: Scott
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-5755-8594"
    affiliation: "Aevion LLC"
keywords:
  - agent safety
  - fail-closed
  - receipt-bound transitions
  - candidate-only self-evolution
  - resume semantics
license: Apache-2.0
